# The terrain the engine shipped with, expressed as stages. The equivalence test in
# extension/tests/test_pipeline_equivalence.cpp asserts the FROZEN golden.pipeline
# (assets/pipelines/golden.pipeline) produces bit-identical bricks to
# ve::AnalyticGenerator; this file has since gained the relief stage below, so that
# claim no longer holds for default.pipeline.
# NOTE: overriding hills amp_* also requires updating the literals in stage_cave's CPU
# mirror (extension/src/terrain/builtin_stages.cpp) -- the cave GLSL reads P.hills_*.
# Edits apply on fresh world init (no C++ rebuild); shader reload keeps the loaded pipeline.
seed      1337
lipschitz 2.0

stage stages/hills.field.glslh
# Long-wavelength relief so a 4 km horizon has something on it. Amplitudes are
# budgeted against the lipschitz 2.0 above -- see relief.field.glslh.
stage stages/relief.field.glslh
stage stages/cave.field.glslh
stage stages/height_bands.field.glslh
